{
    "title": "Methodist My Care\u00ae",
    "description": "The Methodist My Care mobile app helps you find health care providers and locations, pay bills, and request medical records. It also provides access to Methodist Health System\u2019s online portal, where you\u2019ll find your latest health information and services to help you plan, understand and engage in your care.\r\n\r\nThe Methodist My Care mobile app allows you to:\r\n-\tSearch our online directory to find Methodist primary and specialty care doctors and advanced practice practitioners\r\n-\tBrowse all Methodist hospital, clinic, urgent care and other locations in Omaha, Fremont, Council Bluffs and surrounding areas\r\n-\tView your health information and electronic medical records\r\n-\tAccess our online bill pay portal to view balances and make payments\r\n-\tRequest access to your medical records\r\n-\tSchedule appointments with your primary care provider\r\n\r\nIf you need assistance setting up, accessing or navigating your account, visit bestcare.org/signon. Contact your provider\u2019s office directly regarding questions about your health record. Personal health inquiries or concerns posted as comments in the App Store cannot be addressed.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Methodist My Care mobile app helps you find health care providers and locations, pay bills, and request medical records. It also provides access to Methodist Health System\u2019s online portal, where you\u2019ll find your latest health information and services to help you plan, understand and engage in your care.<br><br>The Methodist My Care mobile app allows you to:<br>-\tSearch our online directory to find Methodist primary and specialty care doctors and advanced practice practitioners<br>-\tBrowse all Methodist hospital, clinic, urgent care and other locations in Omaha, Fremont, Council Bluffs and surrounding areas<br>-\tView your health information and electronic medical records<br>-\tAccess our online bill pay portal to view balances and make payments<br>-\tRequest access to your medical records<br>-\tSchedule appointments with your primary care provider<br><br>If you need assistance setting up, accessing or navigating your account, visit bestcare.org/signon. Contact your provider\u2019s office directly regarding questions about your health record. Personal health inquiries or concerns posted as comments in the App Store cannot be addressed.",
